Every clinician should consider a recommendation during a clinician-patient-relationship.
Every clinician-patient-relationship should have a shared-understanding.
Every clinician should consider a recommendation during a whole-person-approach.
Every whole-person-approach should consider a physical-functioning and should consider a psychological-functioning.
Every whole-person-approach should consider a support-need and should consider an expected-health-outcome and should consider a well-being.
Every whole-person-approach should consider a home-environment and should consider a home-responsibility and should consider a work-responsibility.
